hor":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Surely after. De 30:2,6-8; Eze 36:26,31; Zec 12:10; Lu 15:17-19; Joh 6:44,45 Eph 2:3-5; 2Ti 2:25; Tit 3:3-7 I smote. Eze 21:12; Lu 18:13; 2Co 7:10,11 I was ashamed. 3:25; Le 26:41,42; Ezr 9:6; Eze 6:9; 16:61-63; 20:43,44; 36:31 Ro 6:21 I did. 3:25; 22:21; 32:30; Job 13:26; 20:11; Ps 25:7; Isa 54:4; Eze 23:3 Lu 15:30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-31-20","title":"Jeremiah 31:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Is Ephraim. 9; 3:19; Ps 103:13; Pr 3:12; Lu 15:24,32 for. De 32:36; Jud 10:16; Isa 57:16-18; La 3:31,32; Ho 11:8,9 my bowels. Ge 43:30; 1Ki 3:26; So 5:4; Php 1:8 are troubled. Heb. sound. 48:36; Isa 16:11; 63:15 I will. Isa 55:7; 57:18; Ho 14:4; Mic 7:18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-31-21","title":"Jeremiah 31:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Set thee. Isa 57:14; 62:10 set thine. 50:5; De 32:46; 1Ch 29:3; 2Ch 11:16; 20:3; Ps 62:10; 84:5 Pr 24:32; *marg: Eze 40:4; Hag 1:5; *marg: turn. 51:6,50; Isa 48:20; 52:11,12; Zec 2:6,7 O. 4; 3:14; Zec 10:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-31-22","title":"Jeremiah 31:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>How. 2:18,23,36; 4:14; 13:27; Ho 8:5 backsliding. 3:6,8,11,12,14,22; 7:24; 8:4-6; 14:7; 49:4; Ho 4:16; 11:7; 14:4 Zec 7:11 created. Nu 16:30 A woman.[nqbh tcwbb gbr ,] literally \"A female ('one who is only a woman, not a wife, namely a virgin,' says Cocceius) shall encompass a man,\" or a male child: comp. Job 3:3. Which, together with the addition of a new creation, may well be understood to denote the miraculous conception. Hence the Jews have applied it determinately to the Messiah. In Berashith Rabba, (Parash 89) it is said, that as God punished Israel in a virgin, so would he also heal; and in Midrash Tillim, on Ps. 2, R. Huna, in the name of R. Idi, speaking of the sufferings of the Messiah, says, that when his hour is come, God shall say, \"I must create him with a new creation; and so he saith, This day I have begotten thee.\"</p>\n<p>Ge 3:15; Isa 7:14; Mt 1:21; Lu 1:34,35; Ga 4:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-31-23","title":"Jeremiah 31:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>As. 23:5-8; 33:15-26; Isa 1:26; 60:21; Zec 8:3 The Lord. Ru 2:4; Ps 28:9; 122:5-8; 128:5; 129:8; 134:3 O. 50:7; Isa 1:21 and mountain. Ps 48:1,2; 87:1-3; Ob 1:17; Mic 4:1; Zec 8:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-31-24","title":"Jeremiah 31:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>33:11-13; Eze 36:10; Zec 2:4; 8:4-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-31-25","title":"Jeremiah 31:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>14; Ps 107:9; Isa 32:2; 50:4; Mt 5:6; 11:28; Lu 1:53; Joh 4:14 2Co 7:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-31-26","title":"Jeremiah 31:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>Ps 127:2; Zec 4:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-31-27","title":"Jeremiah 31:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>the days. 31 that I. 30:19; Eze 36:9; Ho 2:23; Zec 10:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-31-28","title":"Jeremiah 31:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":31,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":31,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>that like. 44:27; Da 9:14 to pluck. 1:10; 18:7-9; 45:4 so. 24:6; 32:41; Ps 69:35; 102:16; 147:2; Ec